## Maintenance Guidelines

### When Adding New Shortcuts
1. Create monitor module if hold behavior needed
2. Add routing logic in shortcut handler
3. Implement settings commands for persistence
4. Update frontend settings UI
5. Add help documentation
6. Test both modes thoroughly

### When Debugging Shortcuts
1. Check compilation first
2. Trace from UI to execution code
3. Verify state management flow
4. Test event handling completeness
5. Validate persistence layer

This rule ensures robust keyboard shortcut implementations that respect user preferences and maintain consistent behavior across the voice control system.
